$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=zdmert  LOC_AFTER=?

* Mertens third theorem, upper bound with explicit constant: the product of 1 / ( 1 - 1 / p ) over the primes up to R is at most CM log R with CM = exp ( 3 + 2 ( log 4 + 4 ) / log 2 - log log 2 ) (Lean mertensProd_le_log).

